<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-PUBLIC BANK 6-MTH NET UP 25 PCT. [CORRECTED 02:15 GMT 8/8]</title>
<headline>TABLE-PUBLIC BANK 6-MTH NET UP 25 PCT. [CORRECTED 02:15 GMT 8/8]</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		249.94	vs    199.82</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   15.1	 vs     12.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,797.58	vs     1,578.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  469.95	vs	 379.98</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     83.39	vs less   71.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Public Bank Bhd is involved in financial services (corrects to say that the bank is not state-controlled)  and is one of Malaysia's top five banks.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
